text=1x leaf of tarromin,                        1x shrunken ogleroot.                                                                 Mix the tarromin in a vial of water, then add the shrunken ogleroot. Drink when standing within an area prepared with glyphs for this potion to have full effect. Take one dose only, for a new perspective on the world...
